          "file": "backend/AirlineDemo.Api/Investigation/AssessmentExecutionService.cs",
          "line": 65,
          "message": "Assess can submit a request using a basis that stopped being current during assessment (OWASP A08:2025).",
          "confidence": 0.84,
          "category": "security",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "Assess reads CurrentBasis once, then validates claims and submits a request using that captured basis. AssessmentStore.SetCurrentBasis can replace the current basis concurrently, and Assess does not recheck before submission.",
            "failureScenario": "While Assess validates a supported claim against basis version 3, another call stores version 4 as the current accepted basis. Assess can still submit a request carrying version 3 after version 4 is current."
